      "question_text": "If $cosx+cos^{2}x=1$ , then the value of $sin^{2}x+sin^{4}x$ is",
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-body\"> <div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->If  $cosx+cos^{2}x=1$ , then the value of  $sin^{2}x+sin^{4}x$  is\n<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></div>",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->-1\n<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> 1\n<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> 0\n<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> 2<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": null,
      "explanation_text": "$\\begin{aligned} & cosx+cos^{2}x=1 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 1-cos^{2}x=cosx \\Rightarrow sin^{2}x=cosx \\\\ & \\Rightarrow sin^{2}x+sin^{4}x \\\\ & \\Rightarrow cosx+(cosx)^{2}=1 \\end{aligned}$",
      "explanation_html": "<div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p> $\\begin{aligned} &amp; cosx+cos^{2}x=1 \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow 1-cos^{2}x=cosx \\Rightarrow sin^{2}x=cosx \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow sin^{2}x+sin^{4}x \\\\ &amp; \\Rightarrow cosx+(cosx)^{2}=1 \\end{aligned}$ </p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>",
